  data: {
    LLM: "Declare a trump suit you hold even one card of in your first three. Statistically, with 36 cards coming your way, you will likely find more of that suit.\n\nCounting: With 14 packs of each card in play (4 of each suit/rank), you must track how many Aces of Spades have fallen. Once 3 have appeared, the 4th is a 'Bobby' (unbeatable).\n\nSignal Coordination: Use the knock/click system to let your partner know if they should 'bleee' (drain) the opponents' trumps or save their high cards for a long-suit run.",
    Player: "Declare a trump suit you hold even one card of in your first three. Statistically, with 36 cards coming your way, you will likely find more of that suit.\n\nCounting: With 14 packs of each card in play (4 of each suit/rank), you must track how many Aces of Spades have fallen. Once 3 have appeared, the 4th is a 'Bobby' (unbeatable).\n\nSignal Coordination: Use the knock/click system to let your partner know if they should 'bleee' (drain) the opponents' trumps or save their high cards for a long-suit run.",
