    basic: 'Declare a trump suit you hold even one card of in your first three. Statistically, with 36 cards coming your way, you will likely find more of that suit.',
    intermediate: "Counting: With 14 packs of each card in play (4 of each suit/rank), you must track how many Aces of Spades have fallen. Once 3 have appeared, the 4th is a 'Bobby' (unbeatable).",
    advanced: "Signal Coordination: Use the knock/click system to let your partner know if they should 'bleee' (drain) the opponents' trumps or save their high cards for a long-suit run.",
    tips: [
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "Don't waste high cards on small tricks early in the hand. With 36 tricks, the 'endgame' starts much later than in typical Whist.",
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: 'Remember the identical card rule: playing your Ace of Spades after an opponent has already played one means you CANNOT win the trick with it.',
      },
